{"parentUuid":"84070700-3ba2-4ff1-8af7-40be060118e1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01RJNv6V36ryiZHpeu4HjAin","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GS1L9B5tcbKrD7VUbc89Qe","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"github google or-tools issue \"custom propagator\" OR \"propagator extension\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16205,"cache_read_input_tokens":11009,"output_tokens":262,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16205},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":262,"cache_read_input_tokens":11009,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16205,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16205,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cassf2BY1htAp3VjuHybg","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3f886d12-3c43-45a4-8a1d-a90babb5252d","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:10.360Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"8a9de06b-32f8-4eba-8d69-c8bdb39c8c57","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0194TWTGkm4Xh7UYkhu8sdHK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools CP-SAT custom propagator extension API C++ user-defined\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"custom propagator needed ? · google/or-tools · Discussion #3303\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3303\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/tree/stable/ortools/sat\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/docs/README.md at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/docs/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT model on C++\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/u8yiW5KXioU\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"Parameters - The CP-SAT Primer - Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - d-krupke/cpsat-primer: The CP-SAT Primer: Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/d-krupke/cpsat-primer\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"cpmodel package - github.com/google/or-tools/ortools/sat/go - Go Packages\",\"url\":\"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/google/or-tools/ortools/sat/go\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding custom propagators in OR-Tools CP-SAT:\n\nCustom propagators are not generally available in the cp-sat solver. This is an important limitation to be aware of when working with OR-Tools' CP-SAT.\n\nThe search results show that while OR-Tools CP-SAT has built-in propagation mechanisms for various constraint types (such as linear constraints, disjunctive constraints, and cumulative constraints), there is no public API for users to define custom propagators in C++.\n\nThe available documentation and GitHub discussions indicate that OR-Tools CP-SAT focuses on a fixed set of propagators rather than providing an extension mechanism for user-defined propagators. If you need custom constraint propagation logic, you would need to either:\n\n1. Model your constraints using the existing constraint types available in CP-SAT\n2. Consider alternative constraint solvers that support custom propagators\n3. Explore other OR-Tools components that might be suitable for your use case\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d52f9b57-fbaf-4fdf-8187-0ce2674d46e2","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:13.410Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8a9de06b-32f8-4eba-8d69-c8bdb39c8c57","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"3f886d12-3c43-45a4-8a1d-a90babb5252d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GS1L9B5tcbKrD7VUbc89Qe","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"github google or-tools issue \"custom propagator\" OR \"propagator extension\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"custom propagator needed ? · google/or-tools · Discussion #3303\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3303\"},{\"title\":\"Add support to specify custom propagator in the instrumentation CRD · Issue #721 · open-telemetry/opentelemetry-operator\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-operator/issues/721\"},{\"title\":\"Support opentelemetry Javaagent extensions · Issue #1758 · open-telemetry/opentelemetry-operator\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-operator/issues/1758\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Propagator not working · Issue #240 · grafana/faro-web-sdk\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/grafana/faro-web-sdk/issues/240\"},{\"title\":\"Allow users to choose propagator · Issue #320 · open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/issues/320\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - opentelemetry-php/extension-propagator-b3: [READONLY] b3 propagator · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/opentelemetry-php/extension-propagator-b3\"},{\"title\":\"[Doc] How to write custom propagator · Issue #3028 · open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/issues/3028\"}]\n\nI found search results related to your query. The most directly relevant result is from the Google OR-Tools repository:\n\nCustom propagators are not generally available in the cp-sat solver, according to a discussion in the OR-Tools GitHub repository (Discussion #3303 from May 2022).\n\nThe search also returned several results related to custom propagators in OpenTelemetry and other projects, but these are from different repositories (OpenTelemetry Operator, Grafana Faro Web SDK, and OpenTelemetry Java/DotNet) rather than the Google OR-Tools project specifically.\n\nIf you're looking for information about custom propagators specifically in the Google OR-Tools CP-SAT solver, the discussion indicates this is a feature request that hasn't been implemented yet in the main solver.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7f1d9be2-864b-47dc-ab35-211459828b51","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:14.473Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3f886d12-3c43-45a4-8a1d-a90babb5252d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"84070700-3ba2-4ff1-8af7-40be060118e1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GJQy84Vjbv3DDgfRwNrvtk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools CP-SAT add custom propagator subclass PropagatorInterface\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"custom propagator needed ? · google/or-tools · Discussion #3303\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3303\"},{\"title\":\"PropagatorInterface | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/reference/sat/integer/PropagatorInterface\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h at main · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/main/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/tree/stable/ortools/sat\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"},{\"title\":\"cpmpy/cpmpy/solvers/ortools.py at master · CPMpy/cpmpy\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/CPMpy/cpmpy/blob/master/cpmpy/solvers/ortools.py\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat at master · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/tree/master/ortools/sat\"},{\"title\":\"Google AI’s OR-Tools CP-SAT Solver unofficial tutorial Bobak Pezeshki\",\"url\":\"https://ics.uci.edu/~dechter/courses/ics-275/fall-2020/slides/OR-Tools_CP-SAT_Solver_Tutorial.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - d-krupke/cpsat-primer: The CP-SAT Primer: Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/d-krupke/cpsat-primer\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding OR-Tools CP-SAT and custom propagators:\n\nCustom propagators are not generally available in the cp-sat solver. This is a key limitation to understand if you're considering building a custom propagator subclass for OR-Tools CP-SAT.\n\nHowever, OR-Tools does have a `PropagatorInterface` class available. PropagatorInterface is the base class for CP-like propagators. The documentation shows that this interface exists in the OR-Tools library and is referenced in the C++ headers (found in `ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h`), where you can see examples of built-in propagators like `BooleanXorPropagator` that extend this interface.\n\nThe search results also show that there are example propagators like `BooleanXorPropagator` that inherit from `PropagatorInterface` in the OR-Tools source code, demonstrating how the interface is used internally.\n\nIf you need more detailed information about implementing a custom propagator or the exact API of `PropagatorInterface`, I'd recommend checking the official OR-Tools documentation at developers.google.com/optimization or examining the source code directly on the OR-Tools GitHub repository.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"a48a133f-602d-482a-ae6f-f466bed16012","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:15.724Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"84070700-3ba2-4ff1-8af7-40be060118e1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
