{"parentUuid":"e25ba856-add3-4427-9fb5-cfa00308c57c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V8T6xDkjCd9KDo2JGBYpci","type":"tool_result","content":"The server returned HTTP 404 Not Found.\n\nThe response body was not retrieved. If this URL requires authentication, use an authenticated tool (e.g. `gh` for GitHub, or an MCP-provided fetch tool) instead of WebFetch."}]},"uuid":"062d7e4d-f834-438c-9eca-d1c47b623491","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:23.359Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e25ba856-add3-4427-9fb5-cfa00308c57c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"edcc6ce1-7c31-484b-b351-59e7834399ca","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gk8MByfHyTgP6uZuGZhZLa","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools Custom Propagator Discussion Summary\n\nBased on the GitHub discussion #3303, here's what the evidence shows:\n\n## Official Position\n\nLaurent Perron (maintainer) does not explicitly state that custom propagators are unavailable, but the discussion reveals **no support for user-defined propagators** in CP-SAT. Instead of endorsing custom propagators, Perron suggests alternative modeling approaches.\n\n## Recommended Workaround\n\nWhen gregy4 describes needing custom propagators to handle minimal distance constraints between intervals more efficiently, Perron proposes reformulating the problem using built-in constraints:\n\n> \"If you have two optional intervals, you can still add the precedence without any additional interval variable\"\n\nHe then provides code showing how to express precedence relationships directly using `OnlyEnforceIf` conditions rather than creating custom propagation logic.\n\n## Key Limitation Acknowledged\n\nThe user demonstrates that CP-SAT struggles with their 1,815-task instance (generating 31+ million linear2 constraints and consuming massive memory), while Choco solver with a custom propagator handles it in minutes. This performance gap is documented but not addressed with custom propagator support.\n\n## Extension API\n\nThe discussion contains **no mention of a C++ extension API** for custom propagators. The focus remains on reformulating constraints using CP-SAT's existing built-in constraint types."}]},"uuid":"e697e0a1-4b80-4e8d-b75c-2d2c369242a4","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:26.052Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"edcc6ce1-7c31-484b-b351-59e7834399ca","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9a39a38d-3e46-459b-a1ab-ca424fe6f06d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QoKhN5LQWjSXuHKz2UCy29","type":"tool_result","content":"# PropagatorInterface and BooleanXorPropagator Analysis\n\nBased on the provided code, here's what I can determine:\n\n## PropagatorInterface Status\nThe header file does not include the `PropagatorInterface` base class definition. It only shows that `BooleanXorPropagator` inherits from it:\n\n```cpp\nclass BooleanXorPropagator : public PropagatorInterface\n```\n\nThe base class definition exists elsewhere in the codebase and is not visible in this file.\n\n## BooleanXorPropagator Details\n\n**Namespace & Signature:**\n```cpp\nnamespace operations_research::sat {\nclass BooleanXorPropagator : public PropagatorInterface, public LazyReasonInterface {\n  BooleanXorPropagator(absl::Span<const Literal> enforcement_literals,\n                       const std::vector<Literal>& literals, bool value,\n                       Model* model);\n  bool Propagate() final;\n```\n\n## Registration Method\n\nCustom propagators are registered via `\"model->TakeOwnership()\"`. The pattern shown is:\n\n```cpp\nmodel->TakeOwnership(\n    new BooleanXorPropagator(enforcement_literals, literals, value, model));\n```\n\nFor propagators requiring a watcher, use `\"RegisterWith(model->GetOrCreate<GenericLiteralWatcher>())\"` before calling `TakeOwnership()`.\n\n**Note:** The `PropagatorInterface` export status cannot be determined from this header file alone."}]},"uuid":"da26ad24-b2ac-4f8c-bc94-de89662b1c0b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:26.521Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9a39a38d-3e46-459b-a1ab-ca424fe6f06d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
