{"parentUuid":"840dd68f-8e43-4885-aca3-4732e48559fd","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CGvf8acGDfCDt2d81erQeq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Search Result for PropagatorInterface\n\nThe provided webpage content does not contain a definition of `PropagatorInterface` or `class PropagatorInterface`. \n\nThe file shown is `ortools/sat/integer.h`, which displays only the first portion of a 1,959-line header file. The visible content includes class definitions like `IntegerEncoder`, `IntegerTrail`, and related structures, but `PropagatorInterface` is not present in the displayed section.\n\nTo find this class definition, you would need to either:\n1. View the complete file using the \"raw\" view link\n2. Search within the full repository\n3. Check related header files in the SAT solver module"}]},"uuid":"cb9e7e45-3370-4e19-91c6-f1fcb6fdfc05","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:59.355Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"840dd68f-8e43-4885-aca3-4732e48559fd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9379cd7a-50d3-4964-9831-9c858dff9bae","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017bQez4AXWCnWWh5uG5CtPX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"PropagatorInterface\" \"Propagate()\" or-tools sat header\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h at main · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/main/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/precedences.h at master · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/master/ortools/sat/precedences.h\"},{\"title\":\"PropagatorInterface | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/reference/sat/integer/PropagatorInterface\"},{\"title\":\"Propagators API | OpenTelemetry\",\"url\":\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/context/api-propagators/\"},{\"title\":\"cpmpy/cpmpy/solvers/ortools.py at master · CPMpy/cpmpy\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/CPMpy/cpmpy/blob/master/cpmpy/solvers/ortools.py\"},{\"title\":\"custom propagator needed ? · google/or-tools · Discussion #3303\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3303\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - gunvirranu/perturb: 🌎 sgp4 orbit propagation library for modern c++11\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/gunvirranu/perturb\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto\"},{\"title\":\"OpenTelemetry Context Propagation for Better Tracing | Last9\",\"url\":\"https://last9.io/blog/opentelemetry-context-propagation/\"},{\"title\":\"Propagation – Orekit\",\"url\":\"https://www.orekit.org/site-orekit-latest/architecture/propagation.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about `PropagatorInterface` and the `Propagate()` method in the OR-Tools SAT solver context.\n\nThe `PropagatorInterface` is a base class that propagators in OR-Tools' SAT solver inherit from, and the `Propagate()` method is declared as a virtual function (marked as `final`) that implementations must override. \n\nAn example implementation is the `BooleanXorPropagator` class, which inherits from `PropagatorInterface` and implements the `bool Propagate()` method.\n\nAnother example is the `PrecedencesPropagator` class, which inherits from both `SatPropagator` and `PropagatorInterface`, and also implements the `bool Propagate()` method.\n\nThe `Propagate()` method returns a boolean value and is responsible for performing constraint propagation operations within the OR-Tools SAT solver framework. These propagators are registered with the solver and are called during the constraint propagation phase to deduce variable values and detect conflicts.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7158cd83-8759-4a4a-936f-0c4955f818de","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:38:01.353Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9379cd7a-50d3-4964-9831-9c858dff9bae","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"7158cd83-8759-4a4a-936f-0c4955f818de","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3c49824ef52b2cb9","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_012foacdAfeX2mSk86g2rv3j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough evidence now. Let me consolidate.\n\nKey findings:\n1. `PropagatorInterface` exists as a public-named C++ class in `ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h` (and base in `ortools/sat/integer.h`), with virtual `Propagate()` and registration via `model->TakeOwnership()` + `RegisterWith(GenericLiteralWatcher)`.\n2. Discussion #3303 (Perron) — official position: **no recommended user-defined propagator path**; instead recommends model reformulation.\n3. No Python binding for `AddPropagator` / `TakeOwnership` is exposed (search returned no results).\n4. CPMpy: only `DirectConstraint` (calls existing built-in functions) and solution callbacks — not actual propagators.\n\n---\n\n## OR-Tools CP-SAT C++ propagator extension API\n\n- **公开 API 状态**: **技术上\"公开\"**（class 名、虚函数都在 header 里），**官方上 undocumented + 不支持**。`PropagatorInterface` 是 C++ class，但没有 user-extension 教程、没有稳定性承诺，Python/SWIG 层完全没暴露。\n- **关键 source 文件**:\n  - `ortools/sat/integer.h`（base class `PropagatorInterface`，有 `bool Propagate()` 纯虚 + `RegisterWith(GenericLiteralWatcher*)`）\n  - `ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h`（例：`BooleanXorPropagator : public PropagatorInterface, public LazyReasonInterface`）\n  - `ortools/sat/precedences.h`（例：`PrecedencesPropagator`）\n  - 注册模式: `model->TakeOwnership(new MyPropagator(...))` + `propagator->RegisterWith(model->GetOrCreate<GenericLiteralWatcher>())` + `model->GetOrCreate<SatSolver>()->AddPropagator(this)`（在 ctor 里）\n- **官方表态**: GitHub Discussion #3303（2022），用户问能不能加 custom propagator，Perron 没说\"可以 subclass PropagatorInterface\"，反而推荐 reformulate constraint 用现有 built-in。**结论：内部用，外部不推荐**。\n\n## 实施路径\n\n- **公开 API 直接用** ❌ 不行——只能在 C++ 层、且必须把自己的 .cc/.h 编进 OR-Tools 的 bazel/cmake target，纯 Python 装的 ortools wheel 调不到。\n- **Fork + patch 路径**: 项目自建 OR-Tools 分支 → 加 propagator 进 `cp_model_solver.cc` 的 build 路径 → 自编 wheel。**成本: 2-4 周**（bazel/cmake 学习 + OR-Tools build 30-60 min/次 + 跟主线 sync 维护负担永远存在）。**风险: 高**——内部 API 每个 release 都可能改，PROJECT_LOCK 也禁\"修改 certified proof source\"。\n- **替代**:\n  - **IPASIR-UP**（R2 调研过）: 进程外 + 单核 SAT 层，CP-SAT 不直接支持 IPASIR，要换成 CaDiCaL+UP，等于丢 CP-SAT\n  - **CPMpy `DirectConstraint`**: 只能调 ortools 已有 API，不是真 propagator\n  - **PySAT propagator API**: 同上，SAT 层不是 CP 层\n\n## 跟项目契合\n\n- **适用场景**: storage_box overload separation cuts、bridge_hop reachability、phase3b forced-anchor 这类项目特异规则\n- **工时**: 4 周量级（fork OR-Tools + 写 1 个 propagator + 自编 wheel + 维护 sync）\n- **ROI**: **低**。当前已有 add_hint / cut callback / parameter tuning 三条路，硬上 propagator 收益不明显（项目瓶颈是 outer search + Benders cycle，不是 CP-SAT 内部传播强度）；维护负担永远存在；且踩 PROJECT_LOCK 红线（动 certified proof source）。\n\n## verdict\n\n- **路线图新增条目**: **否**\n- **优先级**: **Excluded**\n- **推荐**:\n  - 把这条结论写进 `feedback_verify_solver_param_claims.md`（或同级 memory）：OR-Tools 不提供官方 user-propagator extension，PropagatorInterface 是 internal C++ class，fork-only 路径 ROI 太低\n  - 项目特异规则继续走现有三条路：add_hint（软）+ assumption literal（半硬）+ cut callback（硬，但只在 LP relaxation 层）\n  - 如果未来真碰到必须传播器的场景（极少见），优先尝试 reformulate 成 OR-Tools 已有 global constraint（`AddCircuit` / `AddNoOverlap2D` / `AddCumulative` 组合）\n\n---\n\nSources:\n- [custom propagator needed? - Discussion #3303](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/3303)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h (BooleanXorPropagator example)](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/main/ortools/sat/cp_constraints.h)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/integer.h (IntegerTrail / SatPropagator / AddPropagator)](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/main/ortools/sat/integer.h)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/precedences.h](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/master/ortools/sat/precedences.h)\n- [PropagatorInterface reference (Google docs, 404 — undocumented)](https://developers.google.com/optimization/reference/sat/integer/PropagatorInterface)\n- [CPMpy ortools interface (DirectConstraint pattern)](https://github.com/CPMpy/cpmpy/blob/master/cpmpy/solvers/ortools.py)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1736,"cache_read_input_tokens":37126,"output_tokens":2094,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1736},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2094,"cache_read_input_tokens":37126,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1736,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cassj7MCBNCb5BAqkWFVx","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb6bf9ce-1036-4957-b0d0-d16b150ba1b1","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:38:40.415Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
